WEBVTT

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:07.390
We are now entering Round 13,
a first in Megalobox history!

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:10.340
The champion looks like he's
still more than ready to go,

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.050
but Joe has got to be on his last legs.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.180
Both fighters have been slugging
it out since the round began!

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.890
An astonishing sight to
see in the 13th round!

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.220
And the champion comes out in front!

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.430
Joe is holding up against
the storm of punches.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.760
With just under two
minutes left, both fighters

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.510
have forgotten about defense
and are just slugging it out!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.300
I have no idea how this is gonna turn out!

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.010
And it's over!

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:46.090
We have a winner!

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:51.090
Joe's counter landed perfectly onto Yuri!

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.340
Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe!

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.970
This is truly a miracle!

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:04.300
After 13 grueling rounds,
the first Megalonia champion is...

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.260
..."Gearless" Joe!

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:16.260
Joe! Joe! Joe! Joe...!

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.340
I don't belong in that ring.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:24.470
I finally understand that, "Gearless" Joe.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.990
MEGALOBOX 2

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:45.950
Welcome to Underground Shopping Arcade

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:51.300
Go!

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.920
"Match in progress on level 3"

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.720
It's almost time... Nomad.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:50.260
Murder Kiriya's about to turn the tables!

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:54.680
Anyone who wants to change
their life better bet on Kiriya!

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.300
Give me a break.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.050
This is just an ass whoopin'.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:08.450
Match Over

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.680
In the end, a match comes down to luck!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:13.140
We're all in the same boat.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:17.260
Now, let's swallow that hatred,
and everyone who bet on Nomad's victory,

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.930
please come down to the
bar counter to cash out.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:23.470
Thank you all for coming
to the match today!

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:42.800
They may like the way
you fight in the big city,

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.550
but things are different down here.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:47.470
People come here to see a show.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.590
You know that, don't you?

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:52.510
Then find someone who can keep up with me.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:58.260
Just like you asked,
we're not doing fixed fights.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.800
I have no problem with that agreement.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:05.680
But if you keep pulling that every time,
you're gonna put me outta business.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.430
That's your last payment.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.470
Maybe you should get to know
how the world works a bit more.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.760
This is just Megalo-boxing.

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:27.640
It has been a year since the catastrophic
typhoon hit, devastating various areas,

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.930
but there still hasn't been any sign
of recovery in some areas,

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:34.390
and the people have no choice
but to keep struggling.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:37.510
Damage and casualties were
heaviest in the bay area

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:42.500
One Year Since the Catastrophic Typhoon:
No Hope of Recovery in Sight

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:40.300
and the aftermath from the
devastation can still be seen,

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.390
with no recovery efforts in sight.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:47.510
And now, for the weather.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:59.260
A sinner who continues to waste
his life and wander aimlessly.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.800
Thy name is "Gearless" Joe.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:10.510
Apparently God won't give you
anything you can't handle.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.760
That's ironic, since you
want to be punished.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.890
Shut up.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.720
I'm sure you know this,

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.300
but changing your name
isn't gonna undo the past.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:40.430
And now, Megalobox news!

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:42.510
Let's start with tonight's feature.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:46.140
We've got the second
Megalonia Champion, Edison Liu!

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:50.510
As well as the fighter who made a
miraculous comeback, Mac Rosario!

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:55.640
The dream match between these two
fighters will finally become a reality.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:59.550
This will be the first title bout for Mac.

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:03.890
Tonight, we'll be going over the history
of these two fighters leading up

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:05.430
to the match of the
century in three mon--

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.890
Liu has managed to surpass

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:16.510
the title defense record of his mentor
in his last match, Yuri, and though

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:21.760
it was just an exhibition match,
he has also won against "Gearless" Joe.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:20.430
You're looking a bit pale.
Want some apple juice?

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:22.220
I got some green juice, too.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:27.430
As you all know, Joe is the legendary
boxer who won at the first Megalonia.

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:29.010
Jumping the gun a bit, are we?

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:29.010
But it can be said that
Yuri threw that match

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:33.470
since he willingly too his Gear off.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.470
This painkiller is super effective,
but the risk is just as great.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:39.550
I'm pretty sure you underground boxers
can't live without it, though.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:38.510
Megalo-boxing is evolving at every level.

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:44.890
If "Gearless" Joe were to fight Liu or
Mac now, he'd stand no chance.

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:40.930
Pleasure doing business with you.

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:50.760
"Gearless" Joe disappeared from the public
eye after his exhibition match with Liu.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:50.760
You know, you sorta
look like "Gearless" Joe.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.970
Though there hasn't been
an official announcement,

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:56.300
we can probably speculate
that he has now retired.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:28.140
I wouldn't recommend
taking those with booze.

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:36.800
Though, I can't stop you if you wanna die.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:51.010
Get me some rum and soda,
and add a splash of Tabasco...

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:53.510
Nah, a splash and a half.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:52.930
Outta my way!

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.640
Shit. What're we gonna do?

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:43.890
We can't do this fight if we
can't find anyone to fight him.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:49.010
But everyone freaks the hell out
once they hear his record.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:51.800
He's way too skilled to
be boxing down here.

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:56.090
Not only is he a former pro,
but he's high-ranking.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.840
There's basically no point
betting against him,

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:03.550
so our funds are gonna run dry soon.

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:08.050
All right. We'll have
him sit this one out.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:09.640
I'll fight him.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.470
Who's that?

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:17.680
He's the wandering boxer.

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.300
Ah...

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.090
So you're Nomad.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.430
I heard all about you.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:29.260
Apparently, you've been wandering from
ring to ring every time you get let go.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:33.680
I'm sure you're pretty confident,
but you should sit this one out.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:36.430
This one's the real deal.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.090
That's fine.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:42.090
I won't cause you any trouble.

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:45.680
All you've gotta do is get
that money from the crowd.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:50.590
Well, if he insists...

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.970
All right.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:57.800
I can't say no if you insist that much.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.390
Do what you want.

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:03.800
Just so you know,
I won't do any fixed fights.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.840
This is gonna be an all-out fair fight.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:18.930
It's time.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:26.550
And now, for tonight's main event!

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.550
I've been waiting for this!

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:29.800
In this corner, we have the mysterious,
wandering boxer,

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:34.550
known to beat his opponents
to a bloody pulp, Nomad!

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:35.840
And in this corner,

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:38.590
we've got a high-ranking boxer who's
duked it out in the professional ring.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:42.930
He's the real deal... Chief!

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:48.140
This is our final match of the night.
Make sure you place all of your bets!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.720
I see we're having a fateful reunion.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.640
Take it easy on me.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.970
Whoa, there.

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.590
He's not bad.

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:12.300
Chief!

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:16.340
Hey, Missy. I'm gonna dedicate
tonight's victory to you.

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:52.010
Not bad. He's definitely the real deal.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:57.930
As we figured, everyone's gonna
bet on Chief now.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:58.040
Winner:       Chief

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.140
Hey, guys.

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:33.340
Whose face is more unfortunate?
Me or the other guy?

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:37.260
Hell if I know, but you're definitely
more cheerful and likable.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.390
Wha...?

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:41.050
You're saying that his face,
that looks like he's carrying

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.590
all the misfortune in the world,
and mine are the same?

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:48.220
You should definitely visit
your ENT doc immediately.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.050
I just had my eyes checked out
before the match.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.340
My stomach hasn't been too good lately.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.550
What's the matter?

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:59.640
What's annoying you?

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.470
You've done this countless times.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.300
It's the same as usual.

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:18.970
What exactly are you hoping for?

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.260
Shut up!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:42.930
Your meds wear off, "Gearless" Joe?

00:16:55.140 --> 00:17:00.510
One...! Two...!

00:16:56.090 --> 00:17:00.260
There's an overwhelming
amount of bets on Chief.

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:04.140
This is the cash we're holding for him.

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:06.220
Three...! Four...!

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.220
Chief! Chief! Chief! Chief...!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:08.080
"Winner: Nomad"

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:14.930
Chief! Chief! Chief! Chief...!

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:11.340
Five...! Six...!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:14.930
Seven...! Eight...!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.840
Nine!

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:23.430
Let's end this, Champion

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:59.640
That wasn't enough!

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:14.890
One...! Two...! Three...!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.890
Why...?

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:18.550
Four...! Five...!

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:25.140
Six...! Seven...! Eight...! Nine...!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:22.300
You know why, don't you?

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:29.720
Things don't always go the way you want.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:48.340
Real deal, my ass. You cheating bastard.

00:18:50.470 --> 00:18:53.140
Apparently, you're not happy about this,

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:55.760
but that punch packed a wallop.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:58.260
I could actually feel my brain shaking...

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:00.140
Like a fawn.

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:06.760
You dodged just enough so that
it wouldn't be a fatal blow.

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:09.430
There's no way I hit you hard enough!

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:11.180
Let's not do this.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:15.140
The crowd enjoyed the show.
Isn't that enough?

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.140
You're a professional boxer, aren't you?

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:25.760
You've actually fought in an actual
ring and you aren't embarrassed?

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.800
Well, what about you?

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.970
If you weren't drowning in these,

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:10.890
I might've been the one
on the ground just now.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:14.930
Take care of yourself, Nomad.

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:50.550
Damn, it's cold.

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:54.050
Y'know...

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:56.890
You've got some nerve
dragging me out here.

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:00.800
Then stop following me.

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:05.470
Now, that's all up to you, ain't it?

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:10.430
You got pretty worked up.

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:13.390
You don't even care what happens anymore,

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:16.260
but I guess you've still got
a sliver of pride left.

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:25.720
It's been five years...

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:32.340
So, partner. Where to next?
